OL,3,ALorry driver electrocuted after vehicle
OL,4,Ahit overhead power line
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver of a tipper lorry was
OL,7,Felectrocuted after part of his vehicle
OL,8,Fhit an overhead power line, an inquest
OL,9,Fhas heard.
OL,11,FAndy Lloyd, 56, who ran a family
OL,12,Fbusiness, was delivering a load of
OL,13,Fhardcore to a farm with his 14-year-old
OL,14,Fson when the grab arm on his truck came
OL,15,Finto contact with the 11,000-volt
OL,16,Foverhead cables.
OL,18,FRuthin Coroner's Court heard Lloyd,
OL,19,Ffrom Bod Elian, Llanelian in Conwy,
OL,20,Fclimbed down from the cab and was
OL,21,Felectrocuted when he came into contact
OL,22,Fwith the metal step.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
