OL,3,ALorry driver electrocuted after vehicle
OL,4,Ahit overhead power line
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene in
OL,7,FTan y Dderwen Farm in Betws-yn-Rhos,
OL,8,FConwy on 1 May - less than a month
OL,9,Fbefore he was due to get married.
